{"3294960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sticky Mayhem", "steam_appid": 3294960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticky Mayhem is a rogue-like action game where you can build human towers &amp; can battle with each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your human tower by understanding the physics &amp; balance of human tower building. Pick the right soldiers, armor, weapon, engines, etc. for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, use speed, shape of the tower and your weapons to attack and destroy your opponent.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every round use the earnings to upgrade your soldiers, armor, weapon, engines, etc. for the next forthcoming rounds.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Sandbox mode to experiment on pyramid structure, combination of soldiers &amp; weapons.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticky Mayhem is a rogue-like action game where you can build human towers &amp; can battle with each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your human tower by understanding the physics &amp; balance of human tower building. Pick the right soldiers, armor, weapon, engines, etc. for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, use speed, shape of the tower and your weapons to attack and destroy your opponent.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every round use the earnings to upgrade your soldiers, armor, weapon, engines, etc. for the next forthcoming rounds.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Sandbox mode to experiment on pyramid structure, combination of soldiers &amp; weapons.</p>", "short_description": "A rogue-like action game, where you master the physics &amp; balance of human tower building. Maneuver your human tower and Unleash hilarious mayhem over your opponent. Strategies, build &amp; upgrade your Soldiers, armor, weapons, engines &amp; wheels to create the most ruthless killing tower.", "supported_lang